      "writtenOn": "2026-09-14T03:03:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`getFirmwareInformation` fires `getActiveBmcFirmware` without awaiting it, so `bmcActiveFirmwareId` is often still null when inventory lands. Combined with the [0] fallback, the select can flash the wrong target, then jump when the Manager links arrive.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 62,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 65,
        "endChar": 52
      },
      "revId": "35277ff10da6fe1d5d0fcebe0139bcdcaea4d00b",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4edf353e_4df735d2",
