      "writtenOn": "2026-09-14T03:03:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "empty Targets cannot be expressed.\nbmcweb and the code-update design treat omitted/[] Targets as “find xyz.openbmc_project.Software.MultipartUpdate” (PLDM / multi-component packages). That is exactly the SPI / multi-part story this commit claims to enable.\n\nThe store turns null or [] into the Manager URI. There is no way to omit Targets. Add a distinct option (and a distinct store signal), for example:\n\n* BMC → Manager @odata.id (current default)\n* Inventory member → that member’s @odata.id\n* Image-defined / no target → omit Targets or send []\nDo not overload null for all three.",
